{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3466470/extras/692e319ffb697515201f68b2ccdde440.avif?t=1751056112\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3466470/extras_big/692e319ffb697515201f68b2ccdde440.avif?t=1751056112 width=800 height=296 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Do you like Romance? Comedy? Adven- SQUIRRELS!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re a squirrel at a vacation park, here to chill out and meet some other squirrels. You start out at the Great Squirrel Log where you can grab a bite to eat, sip on a Squirltale, and maybe meet some locals. There's 5 fuzzy tailed-bachelors just waiting for you to get to know them. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After getting to know a bit about the bachelors you can choose which whimsical and romantic date to go on. Where ever you may end up be careful of what you say. Actions have consequences and all squirrels have feelings.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3466470/extras/03ee8d8edb0105af0b7713429d08ee50.poster.avif?t=1751056112\" width=300 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3466470/extras/03ee8d8edb0105af0b7713429d08ee50.webm?t=1751056112\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3466470/extras/03ee8d8edb0105af0b7713429d08ee50.mp4?t=1751056112\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nuts For You is a comedic dating sim where you play as a squirrel in a park and have the choice to date one of five squirrel bachelors. Choices matter and change the outcome of the game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are ten possible endings five good endings and five bad endings. Each choice you make has the opportunity to push you towards one of the good or bad endings. All five of the squirrel bachelors have their own routes you can go down and try to get the good ending will, each have their own unique storyline and backstory that is revealed through the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3466470/extras/6f73a9e2c281120f653a4bcd8f82496d.poster.avif?t=1751056112\" width=300 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3466470/extras/6f73a9e2c281120f653a4bcd8f82496d.webm?t=1751056112\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3466470/extras/6f73a9e2c281120f653a4bcd8f82496d.mp4?t=1751056112\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character Creation:</strong> There are multiple hats you can choose from to decorate your character.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Original Art:</strong>\u00a0Amazing character art and backgrounds pull the story of Nuts For You together creating the best experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Original Soundtrack:</strong>\u00a0The emotional soundtrack helps bring the story to life and immerse the player.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Comedic Story:</strong> Nuts For You at it's core is 